 104:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****      *  Each mux uses 2 configuration bits. These are decoded as follows:
 105:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****      *  00  vss
 106:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****      *  01  refclk_p,refclk_n
