 477:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  *
 478:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  * On startup, MSS supplied with 80MHz SCB clock
 479:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 480:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   9.2  Power on procedure for the MSS PLL clock
 481:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 482:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   During POR:
 483:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Keep PLL in power down mode. powerdown_int_b=0
 484:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c **** 
 485:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   After POR, Power-On steps:
 486:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   1)  mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=0 & powerdown_int_b=0 & clk_standby_sel=0
 487:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL is powered down and selects clk_standby=scb_clk
 488:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   2)  PFC Processor writes powerdown_int_b=1 & divq0_int_en=1
 489:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL powers up, then lock asserts when locked.
 490:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   3)  PFC Processor switches mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=1
 491:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   MSS PLL clock is now sent to MSS.
 492:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   4)  When BOOT authentication is complete
 493:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   a.  PFC processor writes mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=0 to select clk_standby.
 494:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   b.  PFC Processor writes powerdown_int_b=0 to power down the PLL
 495:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   >>>>>>>> G5 Soc User code >>>>>>>>>>>>>>
 496:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   c.  MSS Processor writes new parameters to the MSS PLL
 497:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   5)  MSS Processor writes powerdown_int_b=1
 498:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Start up the PLL with NEW parameters.
 499:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   Wait for LOCK
 500:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   6)  MSS Processor enables all 4 PLL outputs.
 501:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****   7)  MSS Processor writes mssclk_mux_sel_int<0>=1 to select the MSS PLL
 502:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****       clock.
 503:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  *
 504:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/common/nwc/mss_pll.c ****  ******************************************************************************/
